@startuml
title SSD - UC-09 - Productivity Analytics

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "FocusDesktop System" as System

Learner -> System : requestAnalytics(from, to)
System --> Learner : analytics(from, to, totalFocusSeconds, completedSessions, averageSessionSeconds, focusScore, distractionCount)
System --> Learner : dailyBreakdown(days)

note right of System
  Analytics are computed from completed sessions
  and distraction logs. No data leaves the device.
end note

@enduml
